# {{API_NAME}}

A .NET 10 minimal API for managing {{RESOURCE_PLURAL}}, backed by EF Core and PostgreSQL.

## Run locally

```sh
docker compose up --build
curl http://localhost:3033/{{RESOURCE_ROUTE}}
```

OpenAPI is available at `http://localhost:3033/openapi/v1.json` and Swagger UI at `http://localhost:3033/swagger/`.

## Build and test

```sh
make analyze
make build
```

`make analyze` runs local .NET checks. `make build` performs the Docker-first build and black-box test path used in CI.

## Kubernetes manifests

```sh
helm lint ./deploy/{{PROJECT_SLUG}} ./deploy/envoy
helm template {{PROJECT_SLUG}} ./deploy/{{PROJECT_SLUG}}
helm template envoy ./deploy/envoy
```

Review image names, credentials, namespaces, resource settings, and NetworkPolicy assumptions before deploying.
